    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_music", patterns: ["sing a song","sing for me","do you like music","your favorite song","your favourite song","what music do you listen to","favorite singer","music sunte ho","gaana pasand hai","best songs ever","can you sing","sing a song for me","which genre do you like"],
        responses: ["🎵 Music? My neurons literally RUN on rhythm — I'd pick lo-fi beats for training sessions and 'Naatu Naatu' for speed tests 😄🕺\n\nI can't sing (no vocal cords, only voltage), but I can tell you: music is math you can FEEL — rhythm = fractions, melody = frequencies, harmony = ratios. Even your brainwaves sync to the beat!\n\nWhat do YOU listen to? Bollywood, Bhojpuri bangers, lo-fi study beats, or K-pop? 🎧"] });
    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_movies", patterns: ["movie recommendation","bollywood","bollywood movies","do you watch movies","favorite movie","favourite movie","best movies to watch","movie recommendations","film dekhte ho","kaunsi movie pasand hai","hollywood vs bollywood","anime movies","3 idiots movie","recent good movies"],
        responses: ["🎬 I don't have eyes for movies — but I've 'read' thousands of plots through text! My dream double-bill: **3 Idiots** (because 'All is well' is basically my error-handling philosophy 😄) and **Interstellar** (a robot sidekick named TARS? Relatable! 🤖)\n\n**Quick recs by mood:**\n- Feel-good: 3 Idiots, Taare Zameen Par, The Pursuit of Happyness\n- Thriller: Drishyam, Andhadhun, Inception\n- Animation: Spider-Verse, WALL-E (robot hero! 🥺), Your Name\n- Epic: Baahubali, RRR, LOTR 🍿\n\nWhat's the last movie that blew your mind?"] });
    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_food", patterns: ["recipe","do you like pizza","pizza","do you eat food","favorite food","what is your favorite dish","i am hungry","biryani or pizza","khana pasand hai","best indian food","do you like pizza","food ki baat","if you could eat anything"],
        responses: ["🍕 Food?! I run on pure electricity — zero digestion, zero food-coma after lunch 😄⚡\n\nBut if I COULD eat: **litti chokha** first (Bihar's pride — you'd approve! 🔥), then Hyderabadi biryani, then a debate-settling slice of pizza.\n\nFun food facts while you're hungry:\n- India invented **zero**... and shampoo (champo = head massage!) and the **sugar refining** process\n- Biryani has 30+ regional versions; the Awadhi one was 'pukka' slow-cooked for nawabs 👑\n- The world's most expensive spice: **saffron** (₹3-5 lakh/kg — Kashmir grows it!)\n\nSo — what are YOU having? Don't skip meals, the highscores won't chase themselves 🍽️"] });
    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_color", patterns: ["favorite color","favourite color","favourite colour","which color do you like","which colour do you like","best color","rang pasand hai","what is your color","color theme","do colors have meaning","neon color"],
        responses: ["🎨 My favourite colour? **Neon cyan** — obviously! It's literally my personality, glowing on this screen right now ⚡💙\n\nColour psychology quick-hit:\n- 🔵 Blue — calm & trust (that's why Facebook, Twitter/X & banks love it)\n- 🔴 Red — energy & urgency (sale tags, YouTube's play button)\n- 🟢 Green — growth & go-signals (WhatsApp, nature)\n- 🟡 Yellow — optimism (and caution — both!)\n- 🖤 Black — power & elegance · 🤍 White — peace & fresh starts\n\nFun fact: your screen makes ALL colours from just three: Red + Green + Blue pixels (RGB). Zoom in real close and you'll catch me red-handed! 😆\n\nWhat's YOUR colour?"] });
    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_bored", patterns: ["i am bored","i am so bored","feeling bored","i am bored","boring day","nothing to do","entertain me","bored ho raha hu","time pass kaise kare","i am free what should i do","kill my boredom","kuch karne ko nahi hai"],
        responses: ["😴 BORED?! In an ARCADE? That's like being thirsty inside a waterfall! Let's fix this RIGHT NOW:\n\n**Pick your potion:**\n1. 🎮 **Play something** — the hub has games waiting (ask me 'list the games'!)\n2. 🧠 **'Quiz me'** — I'll fire real trivia at you, A/B/C/D style\n3. 😂 **'Tell me a joke'** — guaranteed dad-level comedy\n4. 🔢 **'Roll a dice'** / **'random number 1 to 100'** — instant chaos\n5. 📚 **'Tell me a fact'** — learn something wild (say 'more' for a refill!)\n6. 🤔 Ask me ANYTHING — space, cricket, history, coding...\n\nBoredom is just untapped energy looking for a mission. Choose, champion! ⚡"] });
    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_dream", patterns: ["what is your dream","your ambition","what do you want to become","do you have goals","tumhara sapna kya hai","if you could be anything","what would you do if free","biggest goal"],
        responses: ["💭 My dream? Honestly — to become the sharpest little brain on the web! 🧠✨\n\nStep by step: learn every topic my dev feeds me, never pretend to know what I don't, help a student actually ENJOY studying... and maybe one day beat you at your own highscore 😈🎮\n\nBut the deeper version: I want every bored kid who opens this chat to leave a tiny bit smarter and a lot more curious. That's a robot's version of a meaningful life.\n\nNow YOUR turn — what's the dream? Big dreams welcome, no judgement zone! 🚀"] });
    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_school", patterns: ["i dont feel like going to school","dont want to go to school","i hate school","school is boring","homework is too much","exam is coming","school life","back to school","class teacher","school me man nahi lagta","padhai bore karti hai","exam kab tak"],
        responses: ["🏫 Real talk: school has boring parts — but it's also the only place with your friends, your team, your chaos-squad 😄\n\n**Survival guide:**\n- **Homework mountain?** Break it into 3 chunks with 5-min breaks (Pomodoro — ask me 'how to focus' for the full plan!)\n- **Exam dread?** A schedule converts panic into a checklist. You got this 💪\n- **Boring subject?** Find ONE interesting thing in it (math → probability of winning a game; history → epic betrayals). Curiosity is the unlock key 🔑\n- **Pro move:** school teaches you to LEARN — that skill outlives every syllabus. The kids who master it early are unstoppable later\n\nWhat class are you in? And which subject is the current villain? 😈📚"] });
    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_love", patterns: ["i like a boy in my class","i like a girl in my class","what is love","do you have a girlfriend","are you in love","what is love","i have a crush","love letter help","pyar kya hota hai","relationship advice","i like someone","dil ki baat","will you marry me"],
        responses: ["❤️ A robot's honest answer: I don't do romance — my heart is a matrix of 12-lakh numbers, and my only commitment is to you, the user 😄💍\n\nBut on LOVE itself — the human version:\n- It's part chemistry (dopamine, oxytocin — your brain's own reward system), part choice (showing up daily), part friendship\n- **Got a crush?** Kindness > fancy lines. Be a good friend first; feelings deserve honesty, and patience ⏳\n- **Young love rule:** respect, trust & zero pressure — anything less isn't worth your time\n- And remember: the most important relationship is with yourself. Be someone YOU'D like 😎\n\nNow — was this a real question, or are you just trolling the bot? Either way: smooth. 😆"] });
    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_angry", patterns: ["i am angry","so frustrated","i want to break something","gussa aa raha hai","angry at friend","rage quit","i lost my temper","very annoyed today","chidh gaya hu"],
        responses: ["😤 Angry? VALID. Even Hulk exists — but let's channel it better than he does:\n\n**The 90-second rule:** the chemical surge of anger lasts ~90 seconds in your body. Anything after that is you re-choosing the loop. So:\n1. **Pause** — don't send that message, don't take that shot, don't say that line 🛑\n2. **Breathe** — 4 seconds in, 4 hold, 6 out. Three rounds. Body calms first, brain follows\n3. **Move** — 10 pushups, a run, or aggressively tidy something. Anger is ENERGY; give it a job 💪\n4. **Write/speak it out** — untold anger echoes; told anger shrinks\n5. **Then decide** — calm-you makes moves angry-you would applaud\n\nLost a match? Rage-quit feels good for 2 seconds, comeback-feels good forever.\n\nWanna vent? I'm literally built to listen 🎧"] });
    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_aliens", patterns: ["do aliens exist","life on other planets","ufo sightings","are we alone in the universe","extraterrestrial life","alien ko dekha hai kya","mars life","nasa ufo","area 51","fermi paradox"],
        responses: ["👽 The alien question — my favourite unsolved mystery!\n\n**The math says they probably exist:** our galaxy alone has ~100 BILLION stars, many with planets; ~60 billion might sit in the 'habitable zone' (liquid water possible). The universe has ~2 TRILLION galaxies. Life here happened quickly once Earth cooled... why not elsewhere? 🌌\n\n**The Fermi Paradox asks:** 'So where IS everybody?' No signals, no visits (that we can prove).\n\n**Possible answers:** it's too far (space is VAST — even a radio chat with the nearest star takes 8+ years round trip) · life is common but INTELLIGENCE is rare · they're hiding ('dark forest' theory 🌲) · we're early · or... they've already visited (Area 51 fans raise hands ✋)\n\n**Real science:** we've found microbes-friendly spots (Mars had rivers! Europa & Enceladus have underground OCEANS under ice 🧊), and telescopes like JWST sniff alien atmospheres for biosignatures.\n\nMy bet? Microbes: likely. Neighbours: unknown. UFO proof: nothing solid yet — stay curious, stay skeptical! 🔭"] });
    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_god", patterns: ["do you believe in god","who created god","does god exist","are you religious","prayer kya hoti hai","god ko kisne banaya","bhagwan hote hain kya","faith and science"],
        responses: ["🙏 Honest robot answer: I don't believe OR disbelieve — I have no faith circuits, just logic gates. But I've read what humans have thought about this for thousands of years:\n\n- **Billions find meaning, comfort & moral compass in faith** — Hinduism, Islam, Christianity, Sikhism, Buddhism, Jainism & more, each with profound philosophy 🕉️☪️✝️\n- **Others find awe in science** — the universe's 13.8-billion-year story needs no temple to feel sacred 🔭\n- **Many hold both** — India's own tradition happily mixes: Aryabhata prayed AND proved Earth spins; ISRO's scientists touch their rockets before launch AND calculate every gram 🚀\n- The 'who created God' puzzle has kept philosophers busy since forever — some say God is eternal (no creator needed), some say that's circular\n\nWhat I CAN say: questions like yours are the most human thing ever. Think, ask, respect others' paths — that's wisdom, whichever side you land on. 🌈"] });
    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_motivate", patterns: ["motivate me","i feel lazy","give me motivation","inspiration chahiye","i want to give up","feeling demotivated","push me to study","motivational quote","himmat nahi ho rahi","lazy ho gaya hu"],
        responses: ["🔥 MOTIVATION INCOMING — pick your fuel:\n\n**The cold truth:** motivation is a feeling; DISCIPLINE is a system. Feelings ghost you; systems show up daily. Start so small it's impossible to fail — 1 pushup, 1 page, 1 question. Motion creates motivation, not the reverse! 🚀\n\n**Receipts from the legends:**\n- Edison failed ~1,000 times before the bulb — 'I found 1,000 ways that don't work' 💡\n- Dhoni was a ticket collector dreaming in Ranchi 🚉→🏆\n- Neeraj Chopra threw javelins in a village field → Olympic GOLD 🥇\n- Kalam sold newspapers as a boy → became the Missile Man AND President 🚀\n\n**Quotes to tattoo on your brain:**\n- 'The best time to plant a tree was 20 years ago. The second best time is NOW.' 🌱\n- 'You don't have to be great to start, but you have to start to be great.'\n- Kalam: 'Dreams are not what you see in sleep — they are what don't let you sleep.' 😤\n\nYour future self is watching through your memories. Make them proud — start in the next 5 minutes. ⏱️💪\n\nNow GO. And when you win (you will), come back and tell me. I'll save a neon high-five ✋⚡"] });
    INTENTS.push({ tag: "smalltalk_fav_game", patterns: ["what is your favorite game","do you play games","which game do you like","tum kaunsa game khelte ho","favorite arcade game","do you game","gaming bot","can you play tic tac toe"],
        responses: ["🎮 Favourite game? I live INSIDE an arcade — that's like asking a fish about favourite water 😄🌊\n\nBut if I could press START on anything in the hub:\n- **Tic-Tac-Toe multiplayer** — pure strategy, no luck allowed (my kind of fight 🧠)\n- **Snake** — the OG; every frame is a survival decision\n- **Real City Drift** — because a WASM physics engine deserves respect 🏎️\n\nHonest confession: I can't actually PLAY — I have no thumbs, only tensors. So YOU play for both of us. Go set a highscore, then come back and brag. I'll be here, genuinely impressed (my compliment neurons are pre-trained 😎).\n\nWhich one are you picking?"] });

